<title>JAPAN: Koshien Tochi - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Koshien Tochi - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		967    million	  vs	  755    million</p>
<p> Operating	 prft 94 million	  vs   loss 198    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 98 million	  vs   loss 216    million</p>
<p> Net		 prft 27 million	  vs   loss 221    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 0.79 yen		vs     loss 6.32 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     35 million		vs	  35 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		    vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Koshien Tochi Kigyo KK is the owner of the Koshien bicycle race ground.</p>
</text>
